  m_text: 'Walk around the arcade and play the machines.


    The games you can
    play have a <color=#33E5FF><b>glowing blue circle</b></color> on the floor in
    front of them.

    Step onto the circle and press <b>PLAY</b> on the screen
    beside it.


    Press the <b>MENU</b> button on your controller at any time

    to
    pause, change the volume or leave a game.'
